# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CyberSentinel UEBA — what stays out of source control.
#
# This directory doubles as a live deployment working copy, so the rules below
# are deliberately strict: anything that is runtime state, customer data, or a
# build artifact is excluded. Source, config templates, ops units and docs are in.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Customer / personal data — never commit ──────────────────────────────────
# State bundles carried between deployments: they contain the autoencoder set,
# so they carry the same real usernames models/ does.
ueba-state-restore-*.tar.gz
*-state-restore-*.tar.gz

# Autoencoder weights are named after real entities (usernames and internal IPs),
# so models/ is both a personal-data and a network-recon disclosure. Every file
# here is regenerated by the weekly retrain, so nothing is lost by excluding it.
models/
models_backup_*/
models_staging/
vector_db/
vector_db_staging/
profiles/
data/
training_zips/
archive/

# Live alert + tuning state (real hostnames, usernames, signatures)
ueba_alerts.jsonl
enriched.jsonl
false_positives.json
fp_patterns.json
fp_suppress_stats.json
agents.json
watchlist.json
reports/
notify/

# ── Runtime state, logs, scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.state/
logs/
*.log
nohup.out
output.log
ueba.log
.prepare_done

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Config reads every credential from the environment (see the *_env keys in
# ueba_config.yaml); these are the files that would hold the actual values.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
answers.env
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*

# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dashboard/node_modules/
dashboard/dist/
dashboard/dist.old/
# Superseded static dashboards, last built 2026-04-13 and no longer served
# (ueba_dashboard_server.py only looks at dashboard/dist/).
/dist/
cybersentinel/

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# ── Local backups / superseded copies ────────────────────────────────────────
# Keeping these would ship two versions of the same script and invite someone to
# deploy the wrong one.
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.bak-*
*.stale-*
*.save
*.orig
*.swp
*.tmp
*.stale-jul13-prebatch
crontab.backup.*
crontab.new.*
crontab.reenable.tmp
_staging/
_stg/

# ── Session transcripts / scratch notes ──────────────────────────────────────
claude_ueba_*.txt
.ueba_guide_print_source.html
# Chat exports for teammate handover. Credential-scrubbed, but they still carry
# real usernames, internal addressing and the upstream product name — the same
# reason the alert and profile data below is excluded. Never commit one.
UEBA_chat_export_*.html
UEBA_chat_export_*.md
UEBA_session_transcript*.md

# ── OS / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Screenshots used for issue reports ───────────────────────────────────────
SCR-*.png
*.screenshot.png
ChatGPT Image*.png
